# Canonical PSV RZ VWF font width config.
# This is a compact width policy, not generated from font.tbl.
# Each [advance_groups] key is the pixel advance; the value is the glyph set.
# Tokens: <space>, <upper>, <lower>, <digits>, <vietnamese> are supported,
# but this canonical file keeps explicit groups for deterministic parity.

